Hi:

How about this?

ggplot(data,aes(x=x,y=y)) + geom_point() + geom_path() +
     geom_smooth(method = 'lm', se = FALSE)

The advantage of geom_smooth() is that you can use several types of smoothers - e.g.,  lm, loess, gam - so feel free to play with it.

HTH,
Dennis

