Hi,

Using grid.text(),

library(ggplot2)
print(qplot(1,1), vp=viewport(height=0.8))
grid.text(0.5, unit(1,"npc") - unit(1,"line"), label="I'm (slightly)
out of here!")

HTH,

baptiste

