References: <1v4yIJCq5L0.EktA_G793T4J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/1v4yIJCq5L0/m/nx6rN3bGAQIJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dear all,

I found the answer to my problem. I had to change the data type of x
to "ordered" as follows:
x = ordered(x,levels=c("first","second","last").

Qplot respects this order, so my problem is solved!

Greetz,

Adi

