Hi,
This should get you started:

mtcars.size <- ddply(mtcars, .(cyl), summarize, mpg=mean(mpg), n=length(mpg))
p <- ggplot(mtcars, aes(factor(cyl), mpg))
p + geom_boxplot() + geom_text(aes(label=paste("n =", n)), data=mtcars.size)

-Ista

