Hi David,
Actually I did not know about scale_*_identity. Interesting. Anyway, I
think you can get what you want like this:

ggplot(df, aes(x =x, y = y, alpha=alpha)) +
  geom_point() +
  scale_alpha(breaks=df$alpha, to = c(0.05, 0.50), legend=FALSE)

Best,
Ista

